# Large or sensitive raw data, tracked deliberately per file, not by default.
# Any genuinely confidential data must never be committed here. The Telco
# Customer Churn dataset (SS2) is public, and the STADIOchoice SS3 extract
# (datasets/raw/stadiochoice_ss3/) is explicitly synthetic per its own
# README, so both are tracked.
datasets/raw/*
!datasets/raw/.gitkeep
!datasets/raw/Telco-Customer-Churn.csv
!datasets/raw/stadiochoice_ss3/
!datasets/raw/stadiochoice_ss3/*
